er. It can be written as $\\frac{5}{1}.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I, II, and III.\"" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-06e90bf6-f6d2-5efd-a5e4-806286d273e2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-06e90bf6-f6d2-5efd-a5e4-806286d273e2" :answer-field/id #uuid "06e90bf6-f6d2-5efd-a5e4-806286d273e2" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-2abe6b53-714b-5245-80a1-464fc9aa0c47" :answer-field/choices ["answer-084d112e-cbf2-52ab-b33c-db2db8f2e5ad" "answer-da8778ba-6909-57e5-92c4-9e2a50d98555" "answer-2abe6b53-714b-5245-80a1-464fc9aa0c47" "answer-552f6c3a-fd7a-5147-8d6f-0662a6575f22" "answer-402e9e87-2133-5ebc-b18b-4e9761d1f95c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-084d112e-cbf2-52ab-b33c-db2db8f2e5ad" :answer/id #uuid "084d112e-cbf2-52ab-b33c-db2db8f2e5ad" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-da8778ba-6909-57e5-92c4-9e2a50d98555" :answer/id #uuid "da8778ba-6909-57e5-92c4-9e2a50d98555" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2abe6b53-714b-5245-80a1-464fc9aa0c47" :answer/id #uuid "2abe6b53-714b-5245-80a1-464fc9aa0c47" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I, II, and III" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-552f6c3a-fd7a-5147-8d6f-0662a6575f22" :answer/id #uuid "552f6c3a-fd7a-5147-8d6f-0662a6575f22" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-402e9e87-2133-5ebc-b18b-4e9761d1f95c" :answer/id #uuid "402e9e87-2133-5ebc-b18b-4e9761d1f95c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186171934 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-cca0b3f3-f64a-53b6-8329-0c693549bc28"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-cca0b3f3-f64a-53b6-8329-0c693549bc28" :question/id #uuid "cca0b3f3-f64a-53b6-8329-0c693549bc28" :question/math-academy-id "q-223387" :question/problem "Which of the following numbers are divisible by $7?$\n\nI. $523$\n\nII. $532$\n\nIII. $501$" :question/worked-solution "To check if a number is divisible by $7,$ double the last digit, subtract the result from the remaining digits, and then check if the difference is divisible by $7.$\n\n- For the number $523,$ we have that \n\n$$\n52-2(3)=52-6=46\n$$\n\nwhich is not divisible by $7.$ Therefore, $523$ is not divisible by $7.$\n\n- For the number $532,$ we have that \n\n$$\n53-2(2)=53-4=49\n$$\n\nwhich is divisible by $7.$ Therefore, $532$ is divisible by $7.$\n\n- For the number $501,$ we have that \n\n$$\n50-2(1)=50-2=48\n$$\n\nwhich is not divisible by $7.$ Therefore, $501$ is not divisible by $7.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only.\"" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-1f59470d-4a45-5417-a822-eaa3dc02953a"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-1f59470d-4a45-5417-a822-eaa3dc02953a" :answer-field/id #uuid "1f59470d-4a45-5417-a822-eaa3dc02953a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-c7bd7190-4fcc-5ddc-85ba-33c60cc87c93" :answer-field/choices ["answer-ac2ddf87-b8c7-544a-b0fe-0f9d59990b3b" "answer-59e23be7-e49a-5617-a19a-0b9edeb9ef0e" "answer-644bbb8f-fc0c-52e9-9279-e0d5f67b08dd" "answer-c7bd7190-4fcc-5ddc-85ba-33c60cc87c93" "answer-d9021da8-7e8e-5f02-a09d-4138a97ca091"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ac2ddf87-b8c7-544a-b0fe-0f9d59990b3b" :answer/id #uuid "ac2ddf87-b8c7-544a-b0fe-0f9d59990b3b" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-59e23be7-e49a-5617-a19a-0b9edeb9ef0e" :answer/id #uuid "59e23be7-e49a-5617-a19a-0b9edeb9ef0e" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {