f the following statements are true?\n\nI. $-\\frac{3}{4}$ is a rational number\n\nII. $\\frac{3}{4}$ is a rational number\n\nIII. $5$ is a rational number"] ["question-76ebc4d7-7b51-5dea-a66f-038cad1e5104" :question/worked-solution "A rational number is any number that can be written as the ratio of two integers.\n\nNow, let's go through each number in turn.\n\n- $-\\frac{3}{4}$ is a rational number. It can be written as $\\frac{(-3)}{4}.$\n\n- $\\frac{3}{4}$ is a rational number.\n\n- $5$ is a rational number. It can be written as $\\frac{5}{1}.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I, II, and III.\""] ["question-76ebc4d7-7b51-5dea-a66f-038cad1e5104" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-06e90bf6-f6d2-5efd-a5e4-806286d273e2" :answer-field/id #uuid "06e90bf6-f6d2-5efd-a5e4-806286d273e2"] ["answer-084d112e-cbf2-52ab-b33c-db2db8f2e5ad" :answer/id #uuid "084d112e-cbf2-52ab-b33c-db2db8f2e5ad"] ["answer-084d112e-cbf2-52ab-b33c-db2db8f2e5ad" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-084d112e-cbf2-52ab-b33c-db2db8f2e5ad" :answer/value "I and II only"] ["answer-da8778ba-6909-57e5-92c4-9e2a50d98555" :answer/id #uuid "da8778ba-6909-57e5-92c4-9e2a50d98555"] ["answer-da8778ba-6909-57e5-92c4-9e2a50d98555" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-da8778ba-6909-57e5-92c4-9e2a50d98555" :answer/value "I and III only"] ["answer-2abe6b53-714b-5245-80a1-464fc9aa0c47" :answer/id #uuid "2abe6b53-714b-5245-80a1-464fc9aa0c47"] ["answer-2abe6b53-714b-5245-80a1-464fc9aa0c47" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-2abe6b53-714b-5245-80a1-464fc9aa0c47" :answer/value "I, II, and III"] ["answer-552f6c3a-fd7a-5147-8d6f-0662a6575f22" :answer/id #uuid "552f6c3a-fd7a-5147-8d6f-0662a6575f22"] ["answer-552f6c3a-fd7a-5147-8d6f-0662a6575f22" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-552f6c3a-fd7a-5147-8d6f-0662a6575f22" :answer/value "II and III only"] ["answer-402e9e87-2133-5ebc-b18b-4e9761d1f95c" :answer/id #uuid "402e9e87-2133-5ebc-b18b-4e9761d1f95c"] ["answer-402e9e87-2133