7.$\n\n- For the number $532,$ we have that \n\n$$\n53-2(2)=53-4=49\n$$\n\nwhich is divisible by $7.$ Therefore, $532$ is divisible by $7.$\n\n- For the number $501,$ we have that \n\n$$\n50-2(1)=50-2=48\n$$\n\nwhich is not divisible by $7.$ Therefore, $501$ is not divisible by $7.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only.\""] ["question-cca0b3f3-f64a-53b6-8329-0c693549bc28" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-1f59470d-4a45-5417-a822-eaa3dc02953a" :answer-field/id #uuid "1f59470d-4a45-5417-a822-eaa3dc02953a"] ["answer-ac2ddf87-b8c7-544a-b0fe-0f9d59990b3b" :answer/id #uuid "ac2ddf87-b8c7-544a-b0fe-0f9d59990b3b"] ["answer-ac2ddf87-b8c7-544a-b0fe-0f9d59990b3b" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-ac2ddf87-b8c7-544a-b0fe-0f9d59990b3b" :answer/value "I and II only"] ["answer-59e23be7-e49a-5617-a19a-0b9edeb9ef0e" :answer/id #uuid "59e23be7-e49a-5617-a19a-0b9edeb9ef0e"] ["answer-59e23be7-e49a-5617-a19a-0b9edeb9ef0e" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-59e23be7-e49a-5617-a19a-0b9edeb9ef0e" :answer/value "I only"] ["answer-644bbb8f-fc0c-52e9-9279-e0d5f67b08dd" :answer/id #uuid "644bbb8f-fc0c-52e9-9279-e0d5f67b08dd"] ["answer-644bbb8f-fc0c-52e9-9279-e0d5f67b08dd" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-644bbb8f-fc0c-52e9-9279-e0d5f67b08dd" :answer/value "II and III only"] ["answer-c7bd7190-4fcc-5ddc-85ba-33c60cc87c93" :answer/id #uuid "c7bd7190-4fcc-5ddc-85ba-33c60cc87c93"] ["answer-c7bd7190-4fcc-5ddc-85ba-33c60cc87c93" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-c7bd7190-4fcc-5ddc-85ba-33c60cc87c93" :answer/value "II only"] ["answer-d9021da8-7e8e-5f02-a09d-4138a97ca091" :answer/id #uuid "d9021da8-7e8e-5f02-a09d-4138a97ca091"] ["answer-d9021da8-7e8e-5f02-a09d-4138a97ca091" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-d9021da8-7e8e-5f02-a09d-4138a97ca091" :answer/value "III only"] ["answer-field-1f59470d-4a45-5417-a822-eaa3dc02953a" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-1f59470d-4a45-5417-a822-eaa3dc02953a" :answer-field/type :answer